# Hallmark design handoff (2026-06-10 — "Court Flood")

Read [design.md](mdc:design.md) before any UI work on listed paths. The system is
**studied DNA** ("Court Flood", extracted image-mode from a Fixtured sports-app
reference): navy paper `#0a0f2e`, royal-blue **flood** surfaces `#2b3fbd` (max
one per viewport), accent `#5b8cff`, **white-pill primary CTAs**, sand `#e8c468`
for PB/pro, Archivo Variable condensed 800 uppercase display + Geist body.
**Tennis Neon (lime `#a3e635` on slate) is retired — never reintroduce it.**

## Where tokens live

- Web: `client/src/index.css` `@theme` (semantic: paper/surface/raised/rule/flood/ink/ink-2/muted-2/accent/cta/cta-ink/sand) + `.font-display-condensed` utility.
- Web canvas/SVG draw colours: `client/src/lib/uiColors.ts` (`UI`, `OVERLAY`) — never hardcode hexes in drawing code.
- Mobile: `mobile/src/lib/theme.ts`.
- shadcn vars in `:root` map to the system (dark-first; `.dark` is inert).

## Voice rules (quick)

- Primary CTA = white pill (`bg-cta text-cta-ink rounded-full`); secondary = `bg-white/10 border-white/15 rounded-full`.
- Cards `rounded-2xl bg-surface border-rule`; buttons/chips pill.
- Page H1/section h2 = `.font-display-condensed`; micro-labels uppercase `tracking-[0.16em]`.
- Scores/counts always `tabular-nums`; one loud number per card.
- Max ONE `bg-flood` surface per viewport. `SHOT_TYPE_COLORS` = data encoding, exempt.
- Honest copy: no invented metrics/ratings/testimonials.

