## Do not

- Rebrand away from Court Flood or invent metrics in empty states.
- Reintroduce lime/slate, icon-prefixed headings, shimmer gradients, or hover-scale cards.
- Edit `client/src/lib/` pipeline (except `uiColors.ts`), `shared/*`, or `server/` for UI-only tasks.
